// Fortification gates for the Carrion Concord and the Brood (Iron Gate, Maw Gate), baked into
// assets/buildings/fortifications.pak by tools/gc_artbake
// (`cargo run -p gc_artbake --release -- --config assets-src/buildings/fortifications.ron --out assets/buildings/fortifications.pak`).
// Each gate has four models: its construction stages `#1` (foundation), `#2` (frame) and `#3`
// (nearly done), then the finished gate under its own name, exactly as in data/rosters.
// All four share one texture set (one material) and keep their authored positions in tiles
// (`keep_origin`), with the origin at the middle of the 1x3 footprint on the ground and the door
// facing +z. Sizes and look match the Ember Gate. Sources and scripts: the project's design/buildings/
// folder (docs/21-buildings.md); the Iron Gate is buildings/concord/iron_gate.py and the Maw Gate is
// buildings/brood/maw_gate.py. More faction fortifications (walls, towers) join this pack later.
(
    models: [
        (
            name: "Iron Gate #1",
            source: "shared:grubcraft/buildings/concord/iron-gate/stage1.glb",
            height: 2.25,
            keep_origin: true,
            clips: {},
            lod_triangles: (2500, 900, 300, 120),
            textures: Some((
                albedo: "shared:grubcraft/buildings/concord/iron-gate/albedo.png",
                team: Some("shared:grubcraft/buildings/concord/iron-gate/team.png"),
